\par \tab C\'a8n c\'f8 m\'f4c IV-B Th\'abng t\'ad s\'e8 73ATC/TCT ng\'b5y 30/8/1993 c\'f1a B\'e9 T\'b5i ch\'ddnh h\'ad\'edng d\'c9n thi h\'b5nh Ngh\'de \'ae\'denh s\'e8 55/CP ng\'b5y 28/8/1993 c\'f1a Ch\'ddnh ph\'f1 quy \'ae\'denh chi ti\'d5t thi h\'b5nh lu
\'cbt thu\'d5 doanh thu v\'b5 Lu\'cbt s\'f6a \'ae\'e6i, b\'e6 sung m\'e9t s\'e8 \'aei\'d2u c\'f1a Lu\'cbt thu\'d5 doanh thu.
